          "type": "graph",
          "say": "Take one item: weight one, value fifteen, and capacities zero to four. Each cell does: d p of w is the max of itself, and d p of w minus one, plus fifteen. Run the loop forward. Capacity one reads capacity zero: fifteen. Capacity two reads capacity one, which already includes the item: thirty. Then forty-five, and then sixty. The single item was packed four times. Now run it backward. Capacity four reads capacity three, still zero from before this item: fifteen. Then three, then two, then one, each reading an old value. Fifteen everywhere: the item is used at most once. Backward means every read sees the row before this item.",
